      "originalText": "open_zones_at_turns = \n{\n      t1 = [w2, w5],\n      t2 = [w5],\n      t3 = [w1, w4, ],\n      t4 = [w1, w2, w4, ],\n      t5 = [w1, w2, w3, w4, w5],\n      t6 = [w1, w2, w3, w4, w5],\n      t7 = [w1, w2, w3, w4, w5],\n      t8 = [w1, w2, w3, w4, w5],\n}",
